s of said cocktail once - and that the one with the mix of gasoline and oatmeal provided the best combination of &quot;splash,&quot; stickiness and burning - provided that the carrier was not made of glass too thick to break easily, nor too thin to withstand being thrown (or sling-shot) a distance.  On an unrelated note, wouldn&#39;t it be a shame if some miscreant with a Molotov torched a bunch of CT police cars and/or armored vehicles?  I certainly do.
